  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Review Your Data Story\r\n\r\nYour Task: Test your program, check it with a partner, and reflect on how you used AI Tutor.\r\n\r\nDo This:\r\n\r\n1. Run your program with numbers you choose. Work out the total and the average by hand, and fill out MY TESTING in `story_review.txt`.\r\n2. Trade seats with a partner. Your partner reads your numbers, not your code, and guesses the average. Run your program to check, then fill out MY PARTNER CHECK.\r\n3. Fill out MY REFLECTION.",
